<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link><description>India News Today: Get latest India news and breaking news from India on Times of India. TOI brings the top news headlines from India on Politics, Elections, Current Affairs and more</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-11-03T08:55:37+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/-2128936835.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Tue, 03 Nov 2026 08:55:37 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[EC can't monopolise voter awareness campaigns: SC; sets aside order denying permission to civil society]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ec-cant-monopolise-voter-awareness-campaigns-sc-sets-aside-order-denying-permission-to-civil-society/articleshow/135479975.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135479975.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Supreme Court said the Election Commission cannot monopolise voter awareness campaigns, setting aside the Rajasthan State Election Commission's order denying permission to a civil society group led by Aruna Roy. The bench directed the state poll body to reconsider its request within 48 hours for campaigning ahead of the final phase of Panchayati Raj elections on November 14.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ec-cant-monopolise-voter-awareness-campaigns-sc-sets-aside-order-denying-permission-to-civil-society/articleshow/135479975.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ec-cant-monopolise-voter-awareness-campaigns-sc-sets-aside-order-denying-permission-to-civil-society/articleshow/135479975.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T08:40:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Dhananjay Mahapatra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135480153,imgsize-996084.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Supreme Court seeks Centre’s response on whereabouts of Barman from Bangladesh]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/supreme-court-seeks-centres-response-on-whereabouts-of-barman-from-bangladesh/articleshow/135479950.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135479950.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Wife says he went to Siliguri for treatment, then to Deoghar and now untraceable]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/supreme-court-seeks-centres-response-on-whereabouts-of-barman-from-bangladesh/articleshow/135479950.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/supreme-court-seeks-centres-response-on-whereabouts-of-barman-from-bangladesh/articleshow/135479950.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T08:35:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Dhananjay Mahapatra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135480069,imgsize-186218.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Calibrated non-kinetic measures': How Indian Navy foiled Somali pirates, rescued 20]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/calibrated-non-kinetic-measures-how-indian-navy-foiled-somali-pirates-rescued-20/articleshow/135479329.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135479329.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Indian Navy successfully rescued all 20 crew members from the hijacked fishing vessel Azini off Somalia. The operation involved coordinated efforts with naval and air force assets over 48 hours. Marine Commandos were deployed to secure the vessel after locating it through persistent surveillance. The hijacking posed a significant maritime security concern, as the pirates could have used Azini for further attacks.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/calibrated-non-kinetic-measures-how-indian-navy-foiled-somali-pirates-rescued-20/articleshow/135479329.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/calibrated-non-kinetic-measures-how-indian-navy-foiled-somali-pirates-rescued-20/articleshow/135479329.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T08:08:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135479407,imgsize-162970.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[E-sign for SIR tribunal judges soon, can upload bulk orders on portal]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/e-sign-for-sir-tribunal-judges-soon-can-upload-bulk-orders-on-portal/articleshow/135477340.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135477340.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Election Commission has modernized its tribunal portal to assist West Bengal judges in bulk uploading orders, significantly enhancing appeal processing efficiency. Meanwhile, the home ministry has unveiled three new Foreigners Regional Registration Offices across India, designed to improve accessibility for international visitors. This strategy supports India's mission to establish itself as a premier destination for tourism and education.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/e-sign-for-sir-tribunal-judges-soon-can-upload-bulk-orders-on-portal/articleshow/135477340.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/e-sign-for-sir-tribunal-judges-soon-can-upload-bulk-orders-on-portal/articleshow/135477340.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T05:23:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Bharti Jain</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135477357,imgsize-1527727.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[For 'outstanding vision', Bhutan dedicates one of 108 stupas to PM Modi]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/for-outstanding-vision-bhutan-dedicates-one-of-108-stupas-to-pm-modi/articleshow/135477235.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135477235.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/for-outstanding-vision-bhutan-dedicates-one-of-108-stupas-to-pm-modi/articleshow/135477235.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/for-outstanding-vision-bhutan-dedicates-one-of-108-stupas-to-pm-modi/articleshow/135477235.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-03T05:15:18+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135477246,imgsize-96916.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Marital discord no ground for termination of pregnancy: SC]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/marital-discord-no-ground-for-termination-of-pregnancy-sc/articleshow/135477214.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofind